WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.001
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.035
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.035 --> 00:00:04.036
We hope you're doing
well tonight.

00:00:04.036 --> 00:00:05.038
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:06.138
Former President Trump filed

00:00:06.138 --> 00:00:07.474
a lawsuit yesterday

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:09.008
against The New York Times,

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:10.209
three Times reporters,

00:00:10.209 --> 00:00:11.577
and his niece Mary Trump

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:13.546
for disclosing
his tax documents.

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:15.581
But he might've
given away the game

00:00:15.581 --> 00:00:17.217
because he is suing for

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:20.553
"100 million untaxable dollars."

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:21.621
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:23.156
After former President Trump

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:24.590
filed the lawsuit yesterday,

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:27.627
Mary Trump said
that her uncle is a "loser."

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:30.529
This first reported
by The New York Times.

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:32.599
[ Laughter ]
During his address yesterday

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:34.200
to the UN General Assembly,

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.837
President Biden spoke about the
upcoming World Climate Summit

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:39.639
and called on leaders to,
"bring their

00:00:39.639 --> 00:00:42.708
highest possible ambitions."
Said Australia --

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:44.777
[ Australian accent ]
A knife that's also a beer.

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:46.980
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:50.149
According to a new book,
Russian President Vladimir Putin

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:52.619
told President Biden
on a phone call that he was,

00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:56.555
"upset that Biden called him
a killer" in an old interview.

00:00:56.555 --> 00:00:59.459
Putin was apparently so upset
that two of his aides

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:00.760
committed suicide.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.061
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:03.696
According
to new court documents,

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:06.132
former President Trump's
campaign knew

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:08.501
that the allegations
about broken voting machines

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.136
in the 2020 election were false.

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:13.639
Well, could you have clued in
Mike Lindell?

00:01:13.639 --> 00:01:15.775
Those machines made him go
full Joker.

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:18.711
[ As Lindell ]
Want to know how I got
these scars?

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:19.945
Sharp corners

00:01:19.945 --> 00:01:21.981
on uncomfortable pillows.

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:23.382
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.382 --> 00:01:25.351
In a new interview, British
Prime Minister Boris Johnson

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:27.586
admitted he has six children
and then,

00:01:27.586 --> 00:01:29.555
in a hard-hitting
follow-up question,

00:01:29.555 --> 00:01:31.991
they asked him
to name all of them.

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:32.992
[ As Johnson ]
Uh, well, let's see.

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:36.196
Well, there's Nigel.
Uh, Ian.

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:41.200
Likely a Colin, Walby, Parker.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:44.136
The luxury toy car maker
The Little Car Company this week

00:01:44.136 --> 00:01:47.607
unveiled a child-sized
Aston Martin that will sell

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:49.375
for $120,000.

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:50.943
The name is Bond.

00:01:50.943 --> 00:01:53.045
Unhealthy Parental Bond.

00:01:53.045 --> 00:01:56.248
[ Laughter ]
Reality star Kylie Jenner
yesterday unveiled

00:01:56.248 --> 00:01:58.551
the new products
from her Kylie baby line,

00:01:58.551 --> 00:02:01.887
which include shampoo,
conditioner, bubble bath,

00:02:01.887 --> 00:02:03.089
and lip injections.

00:02:03.089 --> 00:02:06.259
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:08.494
Yeah, that's a huge drag
to look at.

00:02:08.494 --> 00:02:10.129
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.129 --> 00:02:13.499
A winning Mega Millions lottery
ticket that is worth more

00:02:13.499 --> 00:02:17.103
than $400 million was sold
at a pizzeria in New York.

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:19.338
Even crazier, they also sold one

00:02:19.338 --> 00:02:21.541
of those slices
with ziti on top of it.

00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:24.343
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.343 --> 00:02:26.613
And, finally,
Amazon announced yesterday

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:28.347
that it is lobbying
the federal government

00:02:28.347 --> 00:02:32.252
to legalize marijuana,
so, now, it's called...

00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:34.587
And that was the monologue.

